\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Lord, the origin of marriage,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  You are Father of marriage.
\par Adam, first of all creation,\tab 
\par Couldn't live successful life,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par But he sought for a companion
\par His own flesh and his own bone;
\par So the woman was created,
\par For the man to live with her.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Male and female were created
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Out of His great compassion;
\par Two were created but were one.
\par Out of your great holiness,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj They were promised with your blessings.
\par Those who put their trust in Thee,
\par Those who gave themselves up to you;
\par You're our heavenly Father
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-180\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord, for the sake of your promise,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Bless these two married couple
\par Those engaged in matrimony
\par Seeking blessings before Thee
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Be their ruler in their own home
\par And control their hearts desire
\par Intercede everyday for them,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Both in want, also in joy.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

